(7145184, 1094295, 3724, '<td valign="top">The symbol is representative of my highest score for an image in the challenge which was voted below five. (for this image 7 given) The fact that you may not appreciate my comment - with or with out words is irrelevant to me.   <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=753886" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/3724/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_753886.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/3724/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_753886.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/3724/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_753886.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-12-21 00:47:04.</i></td>', 'The symbol is representative of my highest score for an image in the challenge which was voted below five. (for this image 7 given) The fact that you may not appreciate my comment - with or with out words is irrelevant to me.   ', '2013-12-20 07:48:21.000000', '2013-12-21 00:47:04.000000', 0),
(7145361, 1094295, 25024, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by undieyatch:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=753886" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/3724/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_753886.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/3724/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_753886.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/3724/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_753886.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m sorry, but at the risk of offending you with what are probably well meant intentions this sort of thing really irritates me - awards and no comment - it means nothing whatsoever to me. <br/> <br/>What I really want and appreciate is critique, comments good or bad that enable me to reflect on an image, what has worked what hasn''t, something tangible that I can learn from - I learn nothing from a silly symbol without any accompanying comment. The other comments here are far more constructive and useful to me, I welcome and value them.</td>', 'Originally posted by undieyatch:    I''m sorry, but at the risk of offending you with what are probably well meant intentions this sort of thing really irritates me - awards and no comment - it means nothing whatsoever to me.  What I really want and appreciate is critique, comments good or bad that enable me to reflect on an image, what has worked what hasn''t, something tangible that I can learn from - I learn nothing from a silly symbol without any accompanying comment. The other comments here are far more constructive and useful to me, I welcome and value them.', '2013-12-20 16:44:37.000000', NULL, 0),
